  "summary": "signing-party vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that the gpg-key2ps tool in signing-party did not\nproperly sanitize user IDs before passing them to a shell. If a user were\ntricked into processing a specially crafted OpenPGP key, an attacker could\npossibly use this issue to execute arbitrary commands.",
